    "Credentials go on the APIs page: a \"Telnyx\" entry with its API key, or a \"Twilio\" entry with the account SID as client key and the auth token as API key. Leave blank to turn telephony off.": "D'Zougangsdonnéeë kommen op d'APIe-Säit: en \"Telnyx\"-Agang mat sengem API-Schlëssel, oder en \"Twilio\"-Agang mat der Kont-SID als Client-Schlëssel an dem Auth-Token als API-Schlëssel. Eidel loossen, fir d'Telefonie auszeschalten.",
    "From number": "Absendernummer",
    "Your number at the provider, in E.164 form: the setup button verifies it as caller ID, and inbound calls to it are answered by the agent below.": "Deng Nummer beim Ubidder am E.164-Format: de Setup-Knäppchen verifizéiert se als Uruffer-ID, an erakommend Uriff op dës Nummer beäntwert den Agent hei drënner.",
