    "OpenAI project ID": "OpenAI-Projet-ID",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "Uriff gi mat sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com verbonnen.",
    "Allowed countries": "Erlaabt Länner",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "Länner, an déi ugeruff ka ginn, als ISO-Coden mat Komma getrennt, z. B. GB, US. Gëtt beim Änneren op den ausgewielten Ubidder ugewannt an iwwer säi Setup-Knäppchen.",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "Telnyx-Verbindungs-ID",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "D'Telnyx-Stëmmapplikatioun, iwwer déi d'Uriff gemaach ginn. \"Telnyx ariichten\" leet se fir dech un; hir Webhook-URL gëtt automatesch aktuell gehalen.",
    "Set up Telnyx": "Telnyx ariichten",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "Leet d'Stëmmapplikatioun an den ausgoende Profil iwwer d'Telnyx-API un a verifizéiert duerno d'Absendernummer als Uruffer-ID per SMS-Code.",
    "Set up Twilio": "Twilio ariichten",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "Aktivéiert déi erlaabt Länner a riicht d'Absendernummer iwwer d'Twilio-API op de Webhook, verifizéiert duerno d'Absendernummer als Uruffer-ID mat engem Uruff vun Twilio, wann de Kont se net besëtzt.",
    "Public URL": "Ëffentlech URL",
    "Filled in automatically: a Cloudflare quick tunnel is opened to the listener whenever a provider is set, and OpenAI and the provider are pointed at it.": "Gëtt automatesch ausgefëllt: soubal en Ubidder festgeluecht ass, gëtt e Cloudflare-Schnelltunnel bei de Listener opgemaach, an OpenAI an den Ubidder ginn dorop geriicht.",
    "This will take a while.": "Dat dauert eng Zäit.",
